<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">sashihiki zero sa sou dayo</font></b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:23,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">that's right, all the way to zero</font></b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">hibi wo kezuru</font></b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">until we wipe away the days</font></b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kokoro wo sotto</font></b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">gently open your heart</font></b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">hiraite gyutto</font></b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">hiki yosetara</font></b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you pull it close to you</font></b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">todoku yo kitto</font></b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">it will reach you, without a doubt</font></b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">tsutau yo motto sa aa</font></b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">it will come, closer, now</font></b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">iki isoide shiboritotte</font></b></font></font></font>

25
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">we're speeding through life, squeezing it for all of its worth</font></b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">motsureru ashi</font></b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:00,330 --> 00:01:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">our feet are tied</font></b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakedo mae yori zutto sou tooku he</font></b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:01,620 --> 00:01:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">but we still keep going further</font></b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">ubaitotte tsukandatte</font></b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">even if I take it back, and grasp it</font></b></font></font></font>

32
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">kimi janai nara</font></b></font></font></font>

33
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">if you're not the one</font></b></font></font></font>

34
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:34,070 --> 00:01:39,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a custom where balance is preserved
by fighting and removing life.</font>

39
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:42,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the friendship
of the Shinobi world.</font>

40
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:44,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a fight for life with the pride
of the village and</font>

41
00:01:44,790 --> 00:01:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one's own dream on the line.</font>

42
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, I'm convinced.</font>

43
00:01:51,630 --> 00:01:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anything is fine.</font>

44
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just tell us the content
of that fight-for-life test.</font>

45
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well.</font>

46
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, this is where I'd
like to explain the third exam.</font>

47
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:05,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But actually...</font>

48
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please allow me, Gekko Hayate who was
given the task of judge, to speak first.</font>

49
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:15,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave it to you...</font>

50
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something... I'd like you all
to do...</font>

51
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:23,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before the third exam.</font>

52
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And that is a preliminary
to the third exam,</font>

53
00:02:32,210 --> 00:02:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with participation in
the main battle on the line.</font>

54
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Preliminary?</font>

55
00:02:38,470 --> 00:02:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean... preliminary?!</font>

56
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:46,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei, I don't understand
the point of that preliminary.</font>

57
00:02:46,770 --> 00:02:50,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why aren't we doing the next exam
with the remaining test-takers?</font>

58
00:02:51,650 --> 00:02:53,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time around,</font>

59
00:02:53,730 --> 00:02:56,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">perhaps because the first and
second exams were easy,</font>

60
00:02:57,440 --> 00:03:00,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are a few too many
people left, you see.</font>

61
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In accordance with the rules
of the Chunin Exams,</font>

62
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:08,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a preliminary will be held in order to
reduce the number advancing.</font>

63
00:03:09,410 --> 00:03:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way!</font>

64
00:03:11,670 --> 00:03:14,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As Hokage-sama said before,</font>

65
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">many guests will be coming
to the third exam.</font>

66
00:03:19,670 --> 00:03:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we can't have long pointless matches
and our time is limited as well.</font>

67
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:29,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, those of you
not in top physical condition...</font>

68
00:03:31,390 --> 00:03:34,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, is he okay...?!</font>

69
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:37,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The teacher doesn't look well himself?!</font>

70
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me.</font>

71
00:03:39,530 --> 00:03:44,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those of you who wish to drop out,
please speak up now.</font>

72
00:03:45,410 --> 00:03:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The preliminary will
begin immediately, so...</font>

73
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Immediately, you say...?!</font>

74
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we finally made it through
the second exam.</font>

75
00:03:54,380 --> 00:03:56,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a pain...</font>

76
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What about our meal?</font>

77
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:07,010
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Those who Pass</font>

78
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:07,010
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Cut Down to Half?!</font>

79
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:07,010
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">It's a Fight Without Warning!!</font>

80
00:04:08,970 --> 00:04:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

81
00:04:10,730 --> 00:04:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do my best, no matter what!</font>

82
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promised Kabuto-san, too...</font>

83
00:04:17,110 --> 00:04:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And oh...</font>

84
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:23,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I forgot to mention this, but it will
be individual battles from now on.</font>

85
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is your decision, so feel free
to raise your hands and drop out.</font>

86
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's going to quit?!</font>

87
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun?!</font>

88
00:04:36,290 --> 00:04:39,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The waves of pain are
coming faster...</font>

89
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... I knew it.</font>

90
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, you should quit
these preliminaries!</font>

91
00:04:49,140 --> 00:04:49,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

92
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Look, you haven't been yourself</font>

93
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:55,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">ever since you got worked
over by that Orochimaru guy!</font>

94
00:04:56,770 --> 00:04:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That bruise hurts even now, right...?</font>

95
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:01,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bruise...?</font>

96
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:03,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...!</font>

97
00:05:10,740 --> 00:05:13,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave him a parting gift.</font>

98
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun will definitely seek me...
in search of power.</font>

99
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:36,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the only one left.</font>

100
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

101
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:45,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please, quit!</font>

102
00:05:46,610 --> 00:05:48,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... scared.</font>

103
00:05:51,450 --> 00:05:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

104
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:58,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew it.</font>

105
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What shall we do?</font>

106
00:06:00,670 --> 00:06:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should remove him
from the exams</font>

107
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and isolate him with
ANBU bodyguards on him.</font>

108
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:07,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should recommend that
he retire immediately.</font>

109
00:06:07,340 --> 00:06:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not the kind of type to
just obey like that...?!</font>

110
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:16,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, he's of the Uchiha clan.</font>

111
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:18,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you talking nonsense for?!</font>

112
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:20,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make him stop, by force if needed!</font>

113
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark responds even
when one's just building up Chakra</font>

114
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:25,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attempts to forcibly
extract his strength!</font>

115
00:06:26,570 --> 00:06:29,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a prohibited Jutsu that eats
into the body of the one who uses a Jutsu!</font>

116
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:34,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a wonder that kid is even enduring it.</font>

117
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He should really already be dead!</font>

118
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:40,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage-sama!</font>

119
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're in no condition to
fight properly, Sasuke-kun...!</font>

120
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up.</font>

121
00:06:48,090 --> 00:06:49,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand!</font>

122
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet!</font>

123
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you've been enduring the pain
this whole time, right?!</font>

124
00:06:55,810 --> 00:06:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please be quiet!</font>

125
00:06:58,140 --> 00:06:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what you say, Sasuke-kun...</font>

126
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to tell the teachers
about the bruise!</font>

127
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I do that...</font>

128
00:07:08,490 --> 00:07:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

129
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...?!</font>

130
00:07:11,450 --> 00:07:12,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

131
00:07:16,410 --> 00:07:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me... I'll quit.</font>

132
00:07:22,210 --> 00:07:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">K-Kabuto-san...?</font>

133
00:07:28,050 --> 00:07:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see...</font>

134
00:07:32,090 --> 00:07:35,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yakushi Kabuto-kun of
the Leaf Village, correct?</font>

135
00:07:35,550 --> 00:07:37,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, you may step back.</font>

136
00:07:38,470 --> 00:07:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

137
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto-san!</font>

138
00:07:42,230 --> 00:07:43,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why're you quitting?!</font>

139
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:46,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tell me! Why?!</font>

140
00:07:48,650 --> 00:07:49,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

141
00:07:51,110 --> 00:07:52,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Naruto-kun...</font>

142
00:07:53,740 --> 00:07:56,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But my body is worn out.</font>

143
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually before the first exam...</font>

144
00:08:01,710 --> 00:08:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when I wrangled with
the guys from Sound Village,</font>

145
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had no hearing at all in my left ear.</font>

146
00:08:08,210 --> 00:08:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To fight right away...</font>

147
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and to be told that my life would
also be on the line, I can't go on.</font>

148
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:24,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've seen that face a few times.</font>

149
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, I think he dropped out
of the main battle before, as well.</font>

150
00:08:31,070 --> 00:08:33,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is he thinking?</font>

151
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anko.</font>

152
00:08:35,990 --> 00:08:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... yes.</font>

153
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:40,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yakushi Kabuto.</font>

154
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to the data,
he has failed six straight times.</font>

155
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about his background?</font>

156
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:50,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From his time at the Academy,</font>

157
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he was a student who did
not really stand out,</font>

158
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and his grades were ordinary.</font>

159
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He finally passed the graduation
exam on his third try.</font>

160
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that, as for the missions
he carried out,</font>

161
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">two C-ranks and fourteen D-ranks.</font>

162
00:09:03,890 --> 00:09:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a battle record to
write home about.</font>

163
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

164
00:09:10,610 --> 00:09:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...?</font>

165
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:14,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about before the Academy.</font>

166
00:09:14,900 --> 00:09:15,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

167
00:09:16,450 --> 00:09:17,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember the story...</font>

168
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:23,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">about the one boy brought back
from the Kikyo Pass battle?</font>

169
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember.</font>

170
00:09:26,710 --> 00:09:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I recall, I heard an enemy boy survivor
at the battlefield</font>

171
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:35,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was taken back by a Jonin from
the medical unit.</font>

172
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:38,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he's that boy...?</font>

173
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:41,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't take arbitrary actions.</font>

174
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:44,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you forgotten
Orochimaru-sama's orders?</font>

175
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:46,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave it to you guys.</font>

176
00:09:47,770 --> 00:09:48,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You in particular, Yoroi-san.</font>

177
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:53,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There should be no problems
here with your ability.</font>

178
00:09:55,650 --> 00:09:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is where you can
show your strength.</font>

179
00:09:58,780 --> 00:10:03,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those of you who are irritated that
I'm ahead of you.</font>

180
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're Orochimaru-sama's favorite, huh?</font>

181
00:10:07,670 --> 00:10:09,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get all high and mighty, kid.</font>

182
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:12,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand, Senpai.</font>

183
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh.</font>

184
00:10:21,260 --> 00:10:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun... Sasuke-kun...</font>

185
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to play with you guys
a little more.</font>

186
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I do more than this...</font>

187
00:10:30,350 --> 00:10:32,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The old me might get stirred up.</font>

188
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a spy so far as it goes.</font>

189
00:10:37,110 --> 00:10:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I cannot expose myself, here.</font>

190
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:44,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also... if you are going to watch.</font>

191
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:48,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My role of information collecting
has served its purpose...</font>

192
00:10:49,370 --> 00:10:50,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama.</font>

193
00:10:52,250 --> 00:10:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll save the fun, for some other time...</font>

194
00:10:57,130 --> 00:10:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

195
00:10:59,470 --> 00:11:00,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Naruto-kun...</font>

196
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:02,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You too.</font>

197
00:11:17,610 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, there are no others
who will quit?</font>

198
00:11:24,160 --> 00:11:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must tell the teachers,
about Sasuke-kun's bruise!</font>

199
00:11:31,290 --> 00:11:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

200
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet about this bruise.</font>

201
00:11:43,550 --> 00:11:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why're you acting tough like that?!</font>

202
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to watch you suffer
all the time anymore!</font>

203
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me you are...!</font>

204
00:11:51,890 --> 00:11:53,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This has nothing to do with you!</font>

205
00:11:56,020 --> 00:11:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's none of your business.</font>

206
00:12:03,610 --> 00:12:05,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said it once before...</font>

207
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:11,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm an avenger.</font>

208
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:16,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is not just a mere exam to me.</font>

209
00:12:16,590 --> 00:12:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Chunin business has
nothing to do with me.</font>

210
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:28,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Am I strong?"
All I want is the answer to that.</font>

211
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By fighting with those who are strong!</font>

212
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

213
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:36,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Gaara of the desert.</font>

214
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:40,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you there...
Identify yourself.</font>

215
00:12:41,030 --> 00:12:42,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I declare.</font>

216
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are absolutely no match for me.</font>

217
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:50,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I have the opportunity to fight you
in the next exam,</font>

218
00:12:50,490 --> 00:12:53,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we won't run or hide.</font>

219
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:58,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And they're... here!</font>

220
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not allow even you
to take my path away from me!</font>

221
00:13:08,970 --> 00:13:10,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

222
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:12,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

223
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing putting up
a front, you idiot?!</font>

224
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:16,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here Sakura-chan is this worried about you...!</font>

225
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

226
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to fight you, too.</font>

227
00:13:22,690 --> 00:13:23,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

228
00:13:31,700 --> 00:13:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What Orochimaru said
is sitting on my mind.</font>

229
00:13:35,210 --> 00:13:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will let Sasuke do the test...</font>

230
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— and see how things go.
— Wha...?!</font>

231
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hokage-sama...!</font>

232
00:13:41,420 --> 00:13:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, if the Curse Mark opens</font>

233
00:13:44,340 --> 00:13:46,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the power gets even a little bit
out of control,</font>

234
00:13:47,090 --> 00:13:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">get in there and stop it.</font>

235
00:13:48,510 --> 00:13:49,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

236
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...!</font>

237
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:54,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand.</font>

238
00:14:00,690 --> 00:14:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, we will begin the preliminaries.</font>

239
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:08,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The preliminaries to come
will be one-on-one individual battles.</font>

240
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:13,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
actual battle format.</font>

241
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are now exactly twenty people,
so we will conduct ten battles.</font>

242
00:14:20,210 --> 00:14:24,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winners will be able to
advance to the third exam.</font>

243
00:14:25,090 --> 00:14:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no rules at all.</font>

244
00:14:27,170 --> 00:14:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will fight until someone dies,
collapses... or admits defeat.</font>

245
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:39,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... please admit defeat right away
if you don't want to die.</font>

246
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, in case I judge
that a match is over...</font>

247
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">err... I don't want to needlessly increase
dead bodies,</font>

248
00:14:49,950 --> 00:14:52,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so I will intervene and stop the match
or something to that effect.</font>

249
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What holds the key to your destinies is...</font>

250
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open it.</font>

251
00:15:10,220 --> 00:15:11,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This.</font>

252
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The names of two foes will be
randomly selected and</font>

253
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:20,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">displayed on this electronic signboard.</font>

254
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:24,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, let's get right down to it</font>

255
00:15:24,310 --> 00:15:27,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and announce the two names
for the first battle.</font>

