<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Uchiha Sasuke</font></font></b></font>

372
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Yoroi Akado</font></font></b></font>

373
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:40,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Uchiha Sasuke</font></font></b></font>

374
00:15:41,420 --> 00:15:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think it'd be so soon...?!</font>

375
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't ask for more.</font>

376
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way...!</font>

377
00:15:52,010 --> 00:15:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why Sasuke-kun?!</font>

378
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, the two displayed on
the signboard, come forward.</font>

379
00:16:10,570 --> 00:16:16,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the 1st battle, Akado Yoroi and
Uchiha Sasuke have been selected.</font>

380
00:16:17,330 --> 00:16:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No objections, right?</font>

381
00:16:19,830 --> 00:16:20,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right.
— No!</font>

382
00:16:32,300 --> 00:16:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I can do now is watch...</font>

383
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:37,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

384
00:16:38,430 --> 00:16:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

385
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:43,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to fight me, don't lose!</font>

386
00:16:44,060 --> 00:16:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... You're acting strange...</font>

387
00:16:48,610 --> 00:16:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it because of the Curse Mark...?</font>

388
00:16:51,110 --> 00:16:53,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, do your best!</font>

389
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll wait and see...</font>

390
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:01,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pain won't go away!</font>

391
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears the Curse Mark hurts.</font>

392
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:10,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, we will begin the first battle.</font>

393
00:17:13,380 --> 00:17:18,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone other than the two foes,
please move to the upper area.</font>

394
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Kakashi-sensei!</font>

395
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

396
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:35,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

397
00:17:37,910 --> 00:17:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't use the Sharingan.</font>

398
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you knew?</font>

399
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that Curse Mark on your neck
gets out of control,</font>

400
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it could endanger your life.</font>

401
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:51,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I believe it.</font>

402
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, the match will be
called off at that time.</font>

403
00:17:56,470 --> 00:17:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be coming in to stop it,
so good luck.</font>

404
00:18:00,510 --> 00:18:01,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Called off, you say?!</font>

405
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:08,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems this Curse Mark thing
is responding to my Chakra.</font>

406
00:18:15,570 --> 00:18:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is my final Chakra...</font>

407
00:18:19,950 --> 00:18:21,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

408
00:18:27,250 --> 00:18:30,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, stop using the Sharingan!</font>

409
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I carelessly build up Chakra,</font>

410
00:18:33,250 --> 00:18:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it would extract my spirit energy,</font>

411
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:37,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and bring out the Chakra
inside my body to no end.</font>

412
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, in this match,</font>

413
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can hardly use even my regular Jutsu,
not to mention the Sharingan!</font>

414
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... Yoroi's ability is
the worst for you, Sasuke-kun.</font>

415
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:07,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... How will I go...?</font>

416
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't act rashly... Sasuke.</font>

417
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:25,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, please begin.</font>

418
00:19:25,890 --> 00:19:27,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

419
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

420
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

421
00:19:58,760 --> 00:20:00,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He did it!</font>

422
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My strength...?!</font>

423
00:20:21,610 --> 00:20:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is this?</font>

424
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:25,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body strength has suddenly...!</font>

425
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

426
00:20:46,340 --> 00:20:47,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke...!</font>

427
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:50,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... my Chakra...</font>

428
00:20:53,230 --> 00:20:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just noticed now...?</font>

429
00:21:05,340 --> 00:21:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

430
00:21:05,340 --> 00:21:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

431
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

432
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

433
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

434
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

435
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

436
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

437
00:21:37,390 --> 00:21:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

438
00:21:37,390 --> 00:21:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

439
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

440
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

441
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

442
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

443
00:21:51,310 --> 00:22:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

444
00:21:51,310 --> 00:22:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

445
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

446
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

447
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

448
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you forget what happiness is</font></b></font></font>

449
00:22:10,030 --> 00:22:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mina utae</font></b></font></font>

450
00:22:10,030 --> 00:22:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">just sing</font></b></font></font>

451
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hikari ga umare yami ga umare ta</font></b></font></font>

452
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">light is born, and darkness was born</font></b></font></font>

453
00:22:19,290 --> 00:22:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">futatsu wa hitotsu</font></b></font></font>

454
00:22:19,290 --> 00:22:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the two are one</font></b></font></font>

455
00:22:21,620 --> 00:22:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">HARUMONIA kanji Te TEREPASHII</font></b></font></font>

456
00:22:21,620 --> 00:22:27,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">harmonia, feel the telepathy</font></b></font></font>

457
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font></font>

458
00:22:28,340 --> 00:22:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

459
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it!
The pain won't go away!</font>

460
00:22:40,500 --> 00:22:43,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">This damned Curse Mark is
responding all the time!</font>

461
00:22:44,050 --> 00:22:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But I won't let this
exam get called off!</font>

462
00:22:47,630 --> 00:22:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">How will I do?
How should I fight?</font>

463
00:22:50,510 --> 00:22:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Am I strong?</font>

464
00:22:52,180 --> 00:22:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">All I want is the answer to that.</font>

465
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I won't let this thing swallow me up
in a place like this!</font>

466
00:22:58,480 --> 00:23:02,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"Super Eyebrows Jealous! "Lion Combo" is Born!"</font>

